[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 21302.07, "timestamp": "05:55:02", "text": "沒有。我的天哪，我活過來了，吸血鬼肯定傳染了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21311.868, "timestamp": "05:55:11", "text": "。是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21313.99, "timestamp": "05:55:13", "text": "的，你也應該睡覺"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21318.07, "timestamp": "05:55:18", "text": "或服用興奮劑"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21319.99, "timestamp": "05:55:19", "text": "。不要讓"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21341.948, "timestamp": "05:55:41", "text": "熬夜。你為什麼喝咖啡？不吃東西，喝太多咖啡。但是，你知道，你知道我想做什麼嗎？等等。呃，如果"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21357.19, "timestamp": "05:55:57", "text": "我三點就"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 21359.15, "timestamp": "05:55:59", "text": "開始直播就好了，對吧"}]